Package: mlvtoolbox
Type: Package
Title: Contour Geometry and Mid-Level Vision Analysis
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Dirk", "Bernhardt-Walther", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original MLV Toolbox and scientific methods"),
    person("Morteza", "Rezanejad", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Original MLV and GPL-licensed AOF formulation"),
    person("Josep", "Mones i Teixidor", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "GNU Octave image morphology lookup tables"),
    person("Carnë", "Draug", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "GNU Octave image morphology lookup tables"))
Description: Analyses vectorized line drawings using contour orientation, length,
    curvature, junctions, and average-outward-flux medial-axis representations.
    Includes image tracing, stimulus manipulation, reproducible feature tables,
    and explicit handling of degenerate geometry. Implements methods described
    by Walther et al. (2023) <doi:10.3389/fcomp.2023.1140723> as an independently
    maintained R port and extension of the Mid-Level Vision Toolbox, with
    explicit estimator choices and documented departures from reference outputs.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
